MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_001: RRRAAAH!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_002: Phew. The risen dead sure are feisty. I'd swear I've\nkilled that last guy before.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_003: Dunno what they're up in arms about when they\ncould be kicking back in the underworld.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_004: <NCA>"I agree."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_005: <NCB>"Kicking back...in the underworld?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_006: <ACA>You get me. The underworld is supposed to be where\nyou go to your final rest.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_007: <ACB>Yeah. Us Saraminians think of the underworld\nas peaceful.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_008: I always believed it was a good place 'cause Yu Phas\nwatched over it. She saved my ancestors, y'know.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_009: But I don't wanna die if comin' back to fight some\nmore is all I have to look forward to.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_010: I've killed a bunch of enemies in my time. And I've\nseen just as many friends get killed.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_011: I always thought one day we'd all be sitting together\nat a feast on the other side. I'd have a seat there too.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_012: But that was before I saw 'em shamble back to life\nand attack us.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_013: Now how'm I supposed to tell folks I'll see 'em on\nthe other side?
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_014: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_015: Baw haw haw! Well, if they ain't gonna wait for me,\nonly one thing to do.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_016: I'm gonna kill 'em again, that's what! And then I'll\nre-kill 'em and three-kill 'em if I gotta.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_017: <NCA>"So it doesn't bother you after all."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_018: Nah. Even if the underworld's not all it's cracked up\nto be, it's no big deal.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_019: I'll just keep fighting like hell, same as always.\nThat's what you've gotta do too, Promised One!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_020: And if you get swept up into Balor's army, I'll be\nthere to put you to rest.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_021: <NCA>"I'll be counting on it."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_022: <NCB>"I don't plan to die."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_023: <ACA>Just leave it to ol' Tobias Victorno!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_024: <ACB>Oh, good to know. In that case, there's no problem!\nBaw haw haw!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_A_025: Now c'mon, Promised One. The risen dead don't\nrest, and neither can we!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_027: 
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_001: <NCA>"Is there no one here?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_028: 
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_002: Oomph... *cough*
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_003: Wha—
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_004: Urgh... Yeesh, Promised One, you got me pretty\ngood there.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_005: A kick in the side is a hell of a way to wake up.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_006: <NCA>"Is that a compliment?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_007: <NCB>"I'm sorry. It was an accident."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_008: <ACA>Baw haw haw! It's not like it was enough to\ndo me in.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_009: <ACB>Hey, don't sweat it. Awake or asleep, I'm the\ntoughest guy around.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_010: Hang on a sec, though. Hmmm...
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_011: Uh...
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_012: OK, I'm convinced. You're not a ghost.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_013: If you'd come back after dying, I was ready to beat\nyou up on the spot.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_014: <NCA>"So you were waiting in ambush?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_015: Nah. I had something else on my mind.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_016: See, there's something I gotta ask you. Even if I died,\nI couldn't rest until I knew the answer.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_017: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_018: Remind me...
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_029: what was your name again?
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_019: C'mon, can you blame me? Everyone just calls you\n"Promised One."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_020: Baw haw haw! But I'm gonna remember from now\non, honest! I never forget the strong ones.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_021: You're tough enough to save the world, so I'd say you\ndeserve to be called by your right name.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_022: <NCA>"I appreciate that."
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_023: We oughta have a feast to celebrate. All the good\nfood in Dagda is waiting for us after that fight!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_024: <RSDS>Baw haw haw! Good thing you showed up before\nI wasted away.
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_025: 'Cause I wasn't gonna move from this spot until\nI saw you again!
MID_SE_Ism_Tob_S_026: Starting now, I'm gonna use your name so much\nthat I might wear it out.